        "t_handwoven": {
          "type": "technique",
          "settings": {
            "key": "handwoven",
            "number": "03",
            "title": "Handwoven",
            "summary": "Yarns brought together on a handloom.",
            "tagline": "Working at the loom",
            "body": "<p>At the handloom, the weaver brings yarns together to make cloth. Preparing and arranging the yarn is part of the work, alongside the repeated movements of weaving. Different yarns and structures give the finished cloth its particular texture and drape.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HARTWICK_MASTERS_WARP_CLOSE_4R1A4475.jpg",
            "alt": "Warp threads running into the loom, seen close",
            "caption": "",
            "film_title": "",
