            "master_url": ""
          }
        },
        "t_hand_carved_wooden_blocks": {
          "type": "technique",
          "settings": {
            "key": "hand-carved-wooden-blocks",
            "number": "05",
            "title": "Hand carved wooden blocks",
            "summary": "The pattern cut into wood, one block for each colour.",
            "tagline": "The tools behind the pattern",
            "body": "<p>A design is traced onto a prepared wooden block. Using small chisels, the carver removes the spaces around it, leaving the printing surface raised. A pattern with several colours needs a corresponding set of blocks, used together by the printer.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HARTWICK_MASTERS_CARVING_PATTERN_4R1A4442.jpg",
            "alt": "A carver cutting the pattern with a fine chisel",
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/HA LOGO 02 TRIMMED.mov",
            "caption": "Carving the Hartwick block. Silent film.",
            "film_title": "Carving a wooden printing block",
            "transcript": "<p>A silent film. The carver works a small chisel with a mallet, cutting away the ground around the raised design so that the lines of the pattern and the lettering of the Hartwick mark stand proud of the block. Finished blocks are stacked behind the work.</p>",
            "captions": "",
            "date": "2024-12-02",
            "credit": "",
            "master_id": "",
            "master_text": "",
            "master_url": ""
          }
        },
        "t_natural_dye": {
          "type": "technique",
          "settings": {
            "key": "natural-dye",
            "number": "06",
            "title": "Natural dye",
            "summary": "Colour drawn from plants and minerals.",
            "tagline": "Colour from plants and minerals",
            "body": "<p>The original Hartwick archive describes dyes made with materials including indigo, turmeric, pomegranate, iron and clay. Preparing the colour and working it into the cloth require close attention to the material. Tonal variation gives the dyed fabric its individual character.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HARTWICK_MASTERS_DYED_BOBBINS_4R1A4528.jpg",
            "alt": "Blue-dyed yarn wound on bobbins",
            "caption": "",
            "film_title": "",
