          }
        },
        "t_ikat": {
          "type": "technique",
          "settings": {
            "key": "ikat",
            "number": "08",
            "title": "Ikat",
            "summary": "Yarns tied and dyed before they are woven.",
            "tagline": "Tied and dyed before weaving",
            "body": "<p>In ikat, the pattern begins in the yarn. Selected areas are bound to resist the dye before the yarns are woven into cloth. The pattern emerges at the loom, bringing the work of dyeing and weaving together.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/001_HARTWICK_HANDWOVEN_TRIBECA_SKIRT_KHADI_TOKYO_SHIRT_IKAT.jpg",
            "alt": "A handwoven ikat shirt worn with a khadi skirt",
