            "title": "Gota Patti",
            "summary": "Small pieces of ribbon applied and stitched to cloth.",
            "tagline": "Applied and stitched by hand",
            "body": "<p>Gota Patti uses pieces of decorative ribbon applied to cloth and secured with stitching. The arrangement of these small elements builds the larger motif. Close-up photography and film can show the cutting, placement and detail of the handwork.</p>",
